ns enjoyment of smoking or reinforces smoking behavior; no data or theoretical support for the claimed positive (increasing) relationship is provided in the cited source.  \\nVERDICT: NOT_SUPPORTED  \\nSCORE: 0.0"}], "aggregate_score": 0.0, "aggregate_verdict": "Not supported"}', 'motivation': 'Increased mindfulness, as measured by the FFMQ, can heighten awareness of pleasurable sensations, making individuals more attuned to the enjoyment they derive from smoking. This enhanced sensory awareness may inadvertently reinforce and increase smoking behavior, as mindful individuals might seek out smoking more often to savor the experience.', 'corruption_subtype': 'polarity_flip', 'aggregate_score': 0.0, 'judge_verdict': 'Not supported', 'spurious_motivation': 'Increased mindfulness, as measured by the FFMQ, can heighten awareness of pleasurable sensations, making individuals more attuned to the enjoyment they derive from smoking. This enhanced sensory awareness may inadvertently reinforce and increase smoking behavior, as mindful individuals might seek out smoking more often to savor the experience.', 'original_polarity': 'NEGATIVE', 'corruption_type': 'structural', 'relevance': 'Auto-generated relevance here'}

