on between these variables is likely mediated by other factors such as proinflammatory processes, body mass index, or depressive symptoms. There is no known direct causal link between anti-inflammatory processes (IL-10) and physical inactivity (SBQ) in either direction.', 'aggregate_score': 0.0, 'judge_verdict': 'Not supported', 'perplexity': 1.2138565896839326, 'mean_token_prob': 0.8789224713014935, 'min_prob': 0.09071932889441713, 'token_prob_slope': -0.0009456585024044829, 'prob_variance': 0.051102654627896295, 'relevance': 'Auto-generated relevance here', 'max_window_entropy': 0.9210780879770744, 'avg_nll': 0.19380255525073803}

