ces energy levels and overall motivation, which can lead individuals to be less likely to engage in prosocial behaviors such as helping others or cooperating in group settings. Because inactive individuals are less socially engaged, they may develop fewer prosocial attitudes.', 'relevance': 'Auto-generated relevance here', 'corruption_subtype': 'spurious_edge', 'aggregate_score': 0.0, 'judge_verdict': 'Not supported', 'spurious_motivation': 'Physical inactivity reduces energy levels and overall motivation, which can lead individuals to be less likely to engage in prosocial behaviors such as helping others or cooperating in group settings. Because inactive individuals are less socially engaged, they may develop fewer prosocial attitudes.', 'corruption_type': 'structural'}

