ess \\"daily hassles\\" or whether mindfulness practice reduces the number or occurrence of hassle-inducing situations. Therefore the specific claim about mindfulness (FFMQ) directly reducing daily hassles is not addressed by the provided source."}], "aggregate_score": 0.25, "aggregate_verdict": "Partially supported"}', 'motivation': 'Practicing mindfulness, as measured by the FFMQ, directly reduces the number of daily hassles an individual experiences. This is because mindfulness techniques help people avoid situations that would otherwise lead to hassles, thereby decreasing their actual occurrence.', 'relevance': 'Auto-generated relevance here', 'corruption_subtype': 'spurious_edge', 'aggregate_score': 0.25, 'judge_verdict': 'Partially supported', 'spurious_motivation': 'Practicing mindfulness, as measured by the FFMQ, directly reduces the number of daily hassles an individual experiences. This is because mindfulness techniques help people avoid situations that would otherwise lead to hassles, thereby decreasing their actual occurrence.', 'corruption_type': 'structural'}

