leep tend to spend less time socializing during the day. Reduced social interaction inherently leads to increased depressive symptoms, as social engagement is a critical factor for maintaining mood stability and emotional well-being. Therefore, addressing sleep disturbance (PSQI) will automatically resolve depressive symptoms (IDS-SR) by fully restoring social activity, regardless of any other contributing factors.', 'perplexity': 1.4244669639596255, 'mean_token_prob': 0.7948540919848306, 'corruption_type': 'motivation', 'min_prob': 0.02649833419562286, 'token_prob_slope': -0.006163646418940522, 'prob_variance': 0.07406669968620001, 'relevance': 'Auto-generated relevance here', 'max_window_entropy': 1.0391874481192804, 'avg_nll': 0.35379768336336875}

